# Install to ~/.config/labwc/autostart on the Pi driving the 7" screen (the
# file labwc runs at the start of the desktop session). This replaces the
# default entries from /etc/xdg/labwc/autostart (wallpaper, taskbar) so the
# screen is a pure kiosk with no desktop chrome.
#
#   mkdir -p ~/.config/labwc
#   cp kiosk/labwc-autostart ~/.config/labwc/autostart
#
# Keeps kanshi (output/display config) since it's harmless and handles
# reattaching the panel correctly on boot; drops pcmanfm-pi (wallpaper/desktop
# icons) and wf-panel-pi (taskbar) intentionally.

/usr/bin/kanshi &
"$HOME/mojorack/kiosk/kiosk.sh" &
